{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function injectForm<TFormData, TFormValidators, TSubmitReturn>(options): InternalFormApi<TFormData, TFormValidators, TSubmitReturn>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/angular-form/src/inject-form.ts#L38","children":[{"type":"text","value":"inject-form.ts:38"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates and mounts a form in the current Angular injection context."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultValues"},{"type":"text","value":" establish the initial state and inferred form value type.\nForm state changes notify Angular change detection, including OnPush\ncomponents, and the form is cleaned up when the injection context is\ndestroyed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Call this in a component field initializer, constructor, provider factory,\nor another active injection context."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tformdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFormData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tformvalidators","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFormValidators"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormValidators"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FormValidators"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tsubmitreturn","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TSubmitReturn"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSubmitReturn"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FormOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormValidators"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSubmitReturn"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The initial form options. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultValues"},{"type":"text","value":" drive form value\ninference."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"InternalFormApi"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormValidators"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSubmitReturn"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The mounted form API registered for injection-context cleanup."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"@Component({\n  selector: 'app-profile-form',\n  template: `<form></form>`,\n})\nclass ProfileFormComponent {\n  form = injectForm({\n    defaultValues: { name: '' },\n    onSubmit: ({ value }) => saveProfile(value),\n  })\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"tformvalidators","text":"TFormValidators","level":3},{"id":"tsubmitreturn","text":"TSubmitReturn","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction injectForm<TFormData, TFormValidators, TSubmitReturn>(options): InternalFormApi<TFormData, TFormValidators, TSubmitReturn>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [inject-form.ts:38](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/angular-form/src/inject-form.ts#L38)\n\nCreates and mounts a form in the current Angular injection context.\n\n`defaultValues` establish the initial state and inferred form value type.\nForm state changes notify Angular change detection, including OnPush\ncomponents, and the form is cleaned up when the injection context is\ndestroyed.\n\nCall this in a component field initializer, constructor, provider factory,\nor another active injection context.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormValidators\n\n`TFormValidators` *extends* `FormValidators`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TSubmitReturn\n\n`TSubmitReturn`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`FormOptions`\\<`TFormData`, `TFormValidators`, `TSubmitReturn`, `unknown`\\>\n\nThe initial form options. `defaultValues` drive form value\ninference.\n\n## Returns\n\n`InternalFormApi`\\<`TFormData`, `TFormValidators`, `TSubmitReturn`\\>\n\nThe mounted form API registered for injection-context cleanup.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-profile-form',\n  template: `<form></form>`,\n})\nclass ProfileFormComponent {\n  form = injectForm({\n    defaultValues: { name: '' },\n    onSubmit: ({ value }) => saveProfile(value),\n  })\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: injectForm\ntitle: injectForm\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction injectForm<TFormData, TFormValidators, TSubmitReturn>(options): InternalFormApi<TFormData, TFormValidators, TSubmitReturn>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [inject-form.ts:38](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/angular-form/src/inject-form.ts#L38)\n\nCreates and mounts a form in the current Angular injection context.\n\n`defaultValues` establish the initial state and inferred form value type.\nForm state changes notify Angular change detection, including OnPush\ncomponents, and the form is cleaned up when the injection context is\ndestroyed.\n\nCall this in a component field initializer, constructor, provider factory,\nor another active injection context.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormValidators\n\n`TFormValidators` *extends* `FormValidators`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TSubmitReturn\n\n`TSubmitReturn`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`FormOptions`\\<`TFormData`, `TFormValidators`, `TSubmitReturn`, `unknown`\\>\n\nThe initial form options. `defaultValues` drive form value\ninference.\n\n## Returns\n\n`InternalFormApi`\\<`TFormData`, `TFormValidators`, `TSubmitReturn`\\>\n\nThe mounted form API registered for injection-context cleanup.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-profile-form',\n  template: `<form></form>`,\n})\nclass ProfileFormComponent {\n  form = injectForm({\n    defaultValues: { name: '' },\n    onSubmit: ({ value }) => saveProfile(value),\n  })\n}\n```\n"}
